@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Confirm a Done move on a board
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "KanbanBoardPage / BoardView" as page
  participant "UnfinishedTasksDialog" as dialog
  participant "IBoardService / BoardService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api, Application and Domain" #D1FADF
  participant "BoardsController / MoveStoryCommandHandler / StoryStatusTransition" as api
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
note over page, dialog
Entered from "Move by drag or labeled controls": a 409 unfinished-tasks left
the move pending (other moves, drag and Load more stay aria-disabled) and
UnfinishedTasksDialog open with the card's key, title, saved status and count.
end note
alt Keep in progress (or Escape)
  actor -> dialog : Keep in progress, or Escape
  dialog --> page : kept; KanbanBoardPage passes it through completionDecision
  page -> page : BoardView restores the latest acknowledged state; sends no request; ends pending; moveStatus Settled; the prompt reports Settled, so the dialog closes with Settled and focus returns to the card's Move button
else A navigation closes the dialog with no result
  page -> page : KanbanBoardPage relays kept through completionDecision, as if Keep in progress were chosen; BoardView ends the pending move and sends no request
else Mark story Done
  actor -> dialog : Mark story Done
  dialog --> page : confirmed(condition); KanbanBoardPage passes it through completionDecision; the prompt shows saving
  page -> client : L2-021 BoardView resubmits the same MoveStoryCommand (same destination, position and versions) with the returned StoryCompletionCondition; stamped with board ID and generation
  client -> api : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/board/stories/{storyId}/placement (profile P: an active session suffices)
  api -> db : CurrentAccountAuthorization reads current access; for an active session, BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync takes the lock and LoadStoryPlacementsAsync reads mode, versions and the current condition (validation already passed for this command)
  alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
    api --> client : 401; nothing saved
    client --> page : sessionInterceptor calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once; navigation to sign-in destroys the dialog and BoardView; the board is the return route
  else Unexpected 403 (Denied audit; nothing changed)
    api --> client : 403
    client --> page : sessionInterceptor refreshes capabilities; the promise rejects; BoardView restores the latest acknowledged state; ends pending; moveStatus Forbidden
    page --> actor : The prompt reports Forbidden, so the dialog closes with Forbidden (focus returns to the card's Move button); KanbanBoardPage shows the "Your access changed" toast through TOAST_SERVICE, without Retry
  else Lock wait times out (503 with Retry-After) or the commit fails (generic 500)
    api --> client : ProblemDetails with the correlation ID; nothing changed
    client --> page : The promise rejects; the move stays pending; no toast; moveStatus Failed with the reference ID
    page -> dialog : KanbanBoardPage sets the prompt to failed with the reference ID (announced; focus stays on Mark story Done); Mark story Done resends the same command; Keep restores the latest acknowledged state and ends pending
  else Story or workspace missing; delivery mode changed; story or board version stale; story left the sprint
    api --> client : 404, 409 mode-changed, or 409 board-changed; nothing changed
    client --> page : The promise rejects; BoardView restores the latest acknowledged state; ends pending; moveStatus Settled closes the dialog with Settled
    page --> actor : As for a first attempt: a 404 reloads the first batch (without the story, or the project's not-found presentation); ProjectLayoutPage.modeChanged(); or the board-changed page alert, whose Reload board takes focus
  else Unfinished count or task revision changed since the 409 (a task change leaves the story's version and the board version unchanged, so the version checks pass)
    api --> client : 409 unfinished-tasks with the current StoryCompletionCondition; nothing changed
    client --> page : The promise rejects with the new condition; the move stays pending; moveStatus ConfirmationRequired
    page -> dialog : The prompt shows server-count; its alert announces the new count without moving focus; the person confirms again or keeps
  else Condition still current
    api -> db : StoryStatusTransition marks the story Done on every live placement (child tasks unchanged) and bumps the active sprint's version for a member; AddAuditEvent; SaveChangesAsync commits
    api --> client : 200 MoveStoryResult
    client --> page : The promise resolves; a result for an older generation or another board is discarded
    page -> client : Re-read the loaded window of the source and destination columns, as for a first attempt
    page -> page : Adopt them as the latest acknowledged state (a failed re-read keeps the placement with a column alert); end pending
    page --> actor : moveStatus Settled with the announcement closes the dialog with Settled; KanbanBoardPage shows "Story marked Done" with the open-task count through TOAST_SERVICE
  end
end
note over page, client
No response (timeout or network failure) is never treated as a failure:
the board re-reads the affected columns before another move, as for a first
attempt; moveStatus Settled then closes the dialog with Settled. If that read
fails too, the board shows its unconfirmed-move load error with Reload board.
end note
@enduml
